   150	    peak_rss_bytes is the maximum of sampled tree RSS and reaped ru_maxrss
   151	    (KiB on Linux, converted to bytes). The reaped value is a per-process
   152	    peak, not a simultaneous tree sum. Only sampled tree RSS triggers kills.
